@startuml Receiver Registration

title Receiver registration status
caption Target design. Boxes and donations: Receivers and destinations. Decisions D22, D30, D35, D33. ADR 0012.

state "Pending" as Pending : created by a Ground Officer
state "Registered" as Registered : may be a box destination\nor a handover Receiver
state "Suspended" as Suspended
state "Expired" as Expired

[*] --> Pending
Pending --> Registered : Administrator registers
Registered --> Suspended : Administrator suspends
Registered --> Expired : Administrator marks expired
Suspended --> Registered : Administrator re-registers
Expired --> Registered : Administrator re-registers

note right of Registered
  Only Registered lets a convoy travel and a box
  take the Receiver as its destination (D35).
  Leaving Registered makes declarations naming it stale.
end note

note left of Pending
  Only the Administrator changes status.
  The exact transitions are left to implementation.
  Nothing records what kind of body a Receiver is (D33).
end note

@enduml
